---
// Root-level 404 fallback (used when a locale segment can't be resolved at
// all, e.g. a totally malformed path). Redirects to the zh-TW 404 so the
// visitor still lands on a styled, on-brand not-found page rather than a
// blank host-level error page.
---

<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/zh-tw/404" />
    <title>Redirecting…</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>If you are not redirected automatically, <a href="/zh-tw/404">click here</a>.</p>
  </body>
</html>
